    "revision": 1,
    "context": "## Workspace State\nThe workspace is empty \u2014 no existing files to worry about.\n\n## Approach\n- **status_server.py** will use `http.server` from the stdlib (no dependencies), listening on port 3000.\n- **index.html** will be a self-contained static file with inline JavaScript using `fetch()`.\n- Two separate persistent shell sessions will keep both servers alive simultaneously.\n- Verification via `curl` ensures both services respond correctly before finishing.\n\n## Trade-offs\n- Using stdlib only means no `pip install` needed.\n- The static server on port 8000 replaces the default workspace preview, which is expected per the requirements."
  },
